your mileage may vary ...

[] 2. Also in two games I wished for "a blessed +3 broadsword named
[] Stormbringer" and in one I got it & in another I just got a blessed +0
[] broadsword named Stormbringer (still a great weapon). I of course got
[] this information after my demise.

if you wish for a +5 weapon you may get it but the odds favor getting
a +0 weapon.  if you wish for a +3 weapon you have a better chance
of getting it than the +5 weapon but you still may only get a +0 one.
seems like the odds at +3 are about 50-50.

